          "text": "⟪ወወፅአ ፡ ፈረስ ፡ ጸሊም ፡ ወዘይጼዐኖ ፡ መዳልወ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያጸንዕ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዱሪ ፡ ፈረስ ፡ ሲወጣ ፡ አየሁ ፡ የተቀመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጠበትም ፡ ሚዛን ፡ ይዟል ፡ ም ፡ ፬ ፥ ፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": "፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፮ ፤ ወሰማዕኩ ፡ ቃለ ፡ በማእከሎሙ ፡ ለእልክቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አርባዕቱ ፡ እንስሳሁ ፡ ከመ ፡ ቃለ ፡ ንስር ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባራቱ ፡ ኪሩቤል ፡ መካከል ፡ እንደ ፡ ንስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ር ፡ ያለ ፡ ቃል ፡ ሰማሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይብል ፡ መስፈርተ ፡ ሥርናይ ፡ በዲናር ፡ ወሠለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስቱ ፡ መስፈርተ ፡ ስገም ፡ በዲናር ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባንድ ፡ ድሪም ፡ ወርቅ ፡ ላዳን ፡ ስንዴ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይሸመታል ፡ ተርታው ፡ እህል ፡ ግን ፡ በአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንድ ፡ ድሪም ፡ ወርቅ ፡ ሦስት ፡ ላዳን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይሸመታል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወወይንሰ ፡ ወቅብዕ ፡ ኢየዐብሩ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወይንና፡ ቅቤ፡ግን፡ አይታጡም።አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በመንፈቅ ፡ ቢመጡ ፡ (ፈረስ ፡ ጸሊም) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘመነ ፡ ሐሳዌ ፡ መሢሕ ፡ ነው ፡ ጸሊም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለው ፡ በዘመኑ ፡ ረኀብ ፡ ይሆናልና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ በዘመነ ፡ ረኀብ ፡ ቀዩ ፡ ይጠቁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራል ፡ ወፍራሙ ፡ ይቀጥናልና ፡ (ወዘይጼ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዐኖ) ፡ የሚቀመጥበትም ፡ ሚዛን ፡ ይዟል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሚዛን ፡ እንዲያስተካክል ፡ ረኀብም ፡ ያስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተካክላልና ፡ (ወሰማዕኩ) ፡ ባራቱ ፡ ኪሩ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቤል ፡ መካከል ፡ እንደ ፡ ንስር ፡ ያለ፡ ቃል፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገንትቶ ፡ ሲጮህ ፡ ሰማሁ ፡ (ወይብል) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በድሪም ፡ ወርቅ ፡ አንድ ፡ ላዳን ፡ ሥንዴ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይሸመታል ፡ ተርታው ፡ እህል ፡ ግን ፡ አባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሪሙ ፡ ቢል ፡ አንድ ፡ ነው ፡ ባንድ ፡ ድሪ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ ወርቅ ፡ ሦስት ፡ ላዳን ፡ ይሸመታል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲል ፡ ሰማሁ ፡ (ወይንሰ ፡ ወቅብዕ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወይን ፡ ቅቤ ፡ ግን ፡ አይታጡም፡ በዘመነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ረኀብ ፡ ወይን ፡ ቅቤ ፡ አይታጣምና ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ በማእከለ ፡ ዘመን፡ ቢመጡ፡ ፈረስ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጸሊም ፡ ዘመነ ፡ ቀላውዴዎስ ፡ ነው ፡ ጸ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሊም ፡ አለው፡ በዘመኑ ፡ ረኀብ ፡ ሆኗልና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ በዘመነ ፡ ረኀብ ፡ ቀዩ ፡ ይጠቁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራል ፡ ወፍራሙ ፡ ይቀጥናልና ፡ (ወዘይጼ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዐኖ ፡ መዳልወ) ፡ ከእህሉ ፡ መታጣት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የተነሣ ፡ በሚዛን ፡ እስከ ፡ መመዘን ፡ ይደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርሳልና ፡ (ወሰማዕኩ) ፡ ባራቱ፡ ኪሩቤል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መካከል ፡ እንደ ፡ ንስር ፡ ያለ ፡ ቃል ፡ ገን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትቶ ፡ ሲጮህ ፡ ሰማሁ ፡ (ወይብል ፡ መስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈርተ ፡ ሥርናይ) ፡ ባንድ፡ ክፈት፡ ወርቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክፈት ፡ ሥንዴ ፡ ይሸመታል ፡ እህል ፡ ማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለት ፡ ነው ፡ ተርታው ፡ እህል ፡ ግን ፡ ባን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድ ፡ ክፈት ፡ ወርቅ ፡ ሦስት ፡ ላዳን ፡ ይሸ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መታል ፡ (ወይንሰ ፡ ወቅብዕ) ፡ ወይን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅቤ ፡ ግን ፡ አይታጡም ፡ በዘመነ፡ ረኀብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወይን ፡ ቅቤ ፡ አይታጣምና ፡ በሽሕ፡ ቢመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጡ ፡ ፈረስ ፡ ጸሊም ፡ ዘመነ ፡ አብርሃም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ ጸሊም ፡ አለው ፡ በዘመኑ ፡ ረኀብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሆኗልና ፡ ብለህ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሐሣዌ፡ መሢሕ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አውርድ ፡ (ትርፍ) ፡ ጸሊም ፡ አለው ፡ አም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላከ ፡ ፀሐይ ፡ ተናበበኒ ፡ እስኪል ፡ ድረስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በከላውዴዎን ፡ በተልእኮ ፡ ጣዖት ፡ ኑሯ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልና ፡ (ወዘይጼዐኖ) ፡ በሥነ ፡ ፍጥረት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በአእምሮ ፡ ጠባይዕ ፡ ተመራምሮ ፡ ልቡና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውን ፡ በሃይማኖት ፡ እንዳጸና ፡ መናገር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ (ወሰማዕኩ ፡ ቃለ ፡ በማእከሎሙ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አራቱን ፡ ነገሥተ ፡ ኮሎዶጎሞር ፡ ድል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነሥቶ ፡ ሲመለስ ፡ ደስ ፡ ቢለው ፡ በመዋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
